title: mf script list
tags: [[CLI command]] [[Scripting the GUI]]
kind: reference
summary: Print the scripts directory, the scripts the GUI offers, and the templates

Prints the scripts directory, then the scripts the GUI offers — each with its
`# Summary:` line, the way <<key "script:run" "g s">> lists them — then the templates
<<cmd "mf script new">> copies. A directory not installed yet says so, and names
`metafolder-sync-config`.
